  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for preparedness and emergency response to the conflict in South Lebanon through essential supplies and training.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting preparedness by pre-positioning life-saving supplies across Lebanon, including medical items, nutrition supplies for children, hygiene items and education supplies that could become difficult to import or inaccessible during conflict; developing material for Explosive Ordnance Risk Education; and enhancing preparedness of critical water and sanitation systems.</narrative>
  </description>
